DATA = 'Velocity update|v=u+a*t|v,u,a,t|sss0|Constant acceleration; signed 1D.|P:1,-a*t - u;P:-1,-a*t + v;P:-t,-u + v;P:-a,-u + v\nDisplacement|dx=u*t+a*t^2/2|dx,u,a,t|sss0|Constant acceleration; keep physical time branch.|P:2,-a*t^2 - 2*t*u;P:-2*t,-a*t^2 + 2*dx;P:-t^2,2*dx - 2*t*u;P:-a,-2*u,2*dx\nSpeed-distance|v^2=u^2+2*a*dx|v,u,a,dx|ssss|Constant acceleration; both velocity signs may fit.|P:1,0,-2*a*dx - u^2;P:-1,0,-2*a*dx + v^2;P:-2*dx,-u^2 + v^2;P:-2*a,-u^2 + v^2\nAverage velocity|dx=(u+v)*t/2|dx,u,v,t|sss0|Constant acceleration only.|P:2,-t*u - t*v;P:-t,2*dx - t*v;P:-t,2*dx - t*u;P:-u - v,2*dx\nRelative velocity|vr=v1-v2|vr,v1,v2|sss|Same axis; velocity of 1 as seen from 2.|P:1,-v1 + v2;P:-1,v2 + vr;P:1,-v1 + vr\nHorizontal component|v=u*cos(th)|v,u,th|sss|Angles radians. Angle solved by numeric bracket.|P:1,-u*cos(th);P:-cos(th),v;E:\nVertical component|v=u*sin(th)|v,u,th|sss|Angles radians. Angle solved by numeric bracket.|P:1,-u*sin(th);P:-sin(th),v;E:\nProjectile range|R=v0^2*sin(2*th)/g|R,v0,th|+ss|Same launch/landing height; no air; g=9.8.|P:g,-v0^2*sin(2*th);P:-sin(2*th),0,R*g;E:\nProjectile peak|h=v0^2*sin(th)^2/(2*g)|h,v0,th|sss|Height above launch; no air; rising launch.|P:2*g,-v0^2*sin(th)^2;P:-sin(th)^2,0,2*g*h;E:'
